WEBVTT

00:29:29.579 --> 00:29:34.038
I couldn't make it not happen. That's
when I really turned to heroin.

00:29:34.079 --> 00:29:37.038
That's when I was like, OK, if if
the house is going to burn down,

00:29:37.288 --> 00:29:40.371
I'm going to go like the the piece
of this that I in some ways

00:29:40.371 --> 00:29:44.329
I can have control over is I'm going to
actually burn the whole the whole,

00:29:44.704 --> 00:29:47.413
you know, the whole land, like
the whole homestead.

00:29:47.996 --> 00:29:51.621
The hard thing about that is, of course,
some people stay there,

00:29:51.663 --> 00:29:55.996
they get lost there. They're walking
through the ashes forever and luck.

00:29:55.996 --> 00:29:58.788
And I'm so grateful that that
wasn't my fate, you know,

00:29:58.788 --> 00:30:03.204
that that I had to do that stuff
in order to realize that.